annel":null,"source_id":"jike-83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","source_name":"Barret李靖","title":"","summary":"AI 是疯狂提效了，但也带来了系统熵增，带来了更多倍的工作内容。AI Coding 一定需要持续伴随架构治理，一边写一边优化一边重构，如果人还停留在需求执行层面，没有切换到产品视角和用户视角，没有从全局做系统性评估，就一定会被 AI 吃掉更多的时间。而持续性更多工作内容的加入，也势必会加速催化熵增。","body":"AI 是疯狂提效了，但也带来了系统熵增，带来了更多倍的工作内容。AI Coding 一定需要持续伴随架构治理，一边写一边优化一边重构，如果人还停留在需求执行层面，没有切换到产品视角和用户视角，没有从全局做系统性评估，就一定会被 AI 吃掉更多的时间。而持续性更多工作内容的加入，也势必会加速催化熵增。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6affaeda3ce945612ebda7d1","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-20T10:22:18+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:09:46+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"83F8C091-4C46-43B7-B7AC-B90CD72255E7","display_name":"Barret李靖","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fs-eSdFZY-o3eJCp506HPIEBqkXe?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6aff17fa38389f599301e5ce","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"杭州的另外一些角落。","body":"杭州的另外一些角落。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6aff17fa38389f599301e5ce","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FnYykbICO4JRO-GgSFyXPZGtM61Ev3.jpg"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T23:38:34+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:09:46+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","display_name":"刘飞Lufy","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FnYykbICO4JRO-GgSFyXPZGtM61Ev3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FsWD9GqZbKTHIe_NgPhjkekl8fXdv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FlQuGB3J775kaLPpJ3NYatVqhflfv3.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FqSwSdLJtCqu9Ucct4iNps5Xu3pRv3.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FgT6fF6ajicCzhzz5Jmcxqhe0X5Sv3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe85f8136b2761c60c518b","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","source_name":"艾逗笔","title":"","summary":"我最近半个月一直在用 t3code，主要原因是我把工作环境从原来的 mac pro 迁移到了家里的 mac mini，我需要一个可以跨设备操控 agent 的方案，t3 刚好能满足这个需求 t3 让我喜欢的几个点 1. 可以跨设备访问，有手机 app，可以随时操控其他设备上的 agent，出门不带电脑时，还能继续工作 2. 可以在同一对话切换 agent，能继承上下文，claude code 挂了…","body":"我最近半个月一直在用 t3code，主要原因是我把工作环境从原来的 mac pro 迁移到了家里的 mac mini，我需要一个可以跨设备操控 agent 的方案，t3 刚好能满足这个需求\n\nt3 让我喜欢的几个点\n\n1. 可以跨设备访问，有手机 app，可以随时操控其他设备上的 agent，出门不带电脑时，还能继续工作\n\n2. 可以在同一对话切换 agent，能继承上下文，claude code 挂了随时切换 codex，不影响工作\n\n3. GUI，视觉方面看起来比 TUI 要舒服一些\n\n其他像是状态通知、token 统计之类的功能我没怎么用，感触不深\n\n深入使用了半个月，我觉得 t3code 还是不太符合我的使用习惯，主要几点\n\n1. 跟 codex 一样的问题，按照文件夹组织项目，每个项目下只能挂一层的 session，并行 session 很多的情况下，切换起来很麻烦，GUI 占的视图太宽，基本上每个页面只能跑一个窗格\n\n2. 因为是 GUI，所以基本都是通过 ACP 去调度 agent，每次对话都有连接损耗，再加上跨设备组网延时，经常遇到 agent 连接中断的问题，很影响工作效率\n\n3. agent session 状态展示很迷，我经常不知道哪个任务跑到了什么状态，也很难快速感知和切换到需要我输入的 session\n\n最终还是决定换回使用 termany.sh\n\nTermany 最大的卖点是多层级文件树，workspace * page * tab * pane，我可以同时跑的 agent session 更多，一个窗口平铺显示多个 agent 对话，看起来更直观\n\nTermany 主要是 TUI，用的是 agent 的原生 cli，不需要通过 ACP 去连接，响应速度更快\n\nTermany 之前没有跨设备互联能力，影响外出时的开发效率，我写了个组网服务 nex\n\ngithub.com/thinkany-ai/nex\n\n解决了这个问题。\n\nTermany 没有手机 app，这个也在做了，配合组网服务，就能随时随地操控不同设备上的 agent\n\nTermany 还不支持在不同 agent 之间同步上下文，让 agent 可以无缝衔接工作\n\n等把手机 app 和跨 agent 共享上下文的功能做完，就再也没有使用 t3code 的理由了，termany.sh 真香。😍","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe85f8136b2761c60c518b","image":null,"published_at":"2026-11-19T13:15:36+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:09:46+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","display_name":"艾逗笔","media":[],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FoAURh6-IxhcgXHbHM2QZe1DIxg8v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe6dc3320fd7e1b577b7ad","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","source_name":"艾逗笔","title":"","summary":"https://termany.sh 云端互联版本来了，登录同一个 Termany 账号，实现跨设备互联，终端跑在家里的 mac mini 上，多任务并行，出门用另一台设备的 Termany 或者 web 版 https://termany.ai 访问，随处接入，无缝衔接，非常方便。","body":"https://termany.sh 云端互联版本来了，登录同一个 Termany 账号，实现跨设备互联，终端跑在家里的 mac mini 上，多任务并行，出门用另一台设备的 Termany 或者 web 版 https://termany.ai 访问，随处接入，无缝衔接，非常方便。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afe6dc3320fd7e1b577b7ad","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FvI29jJX3Xtw_lliWXUnKfbP-GpXv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:32:19+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:09:46+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"jike","handle":"35224A78-8B11-469E-B307-16B58688FBEC","display_name":"艾逗笔","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FvI29jJX3Xtw_lliWXUnKfbP-GpXv3.png?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/auto-orient/thumbnail/1080x%3E"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/FoAURh6-IxhcgXHbHM2QZe1DIxg8v3.jpg?imageMogr2/auto-orient/heic-exif/1/format/jpeg/thumbnail/!1000x1000r/gravity/Center/crop/!1000x1000a0a0"},"translated":false},{"id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF:https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdd9e3320fd7e1b568330d","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"jike-BB769515-C724-4652-8838-6AA32EC1A8DF","source_name":"刘飞Lufy","title":"","summary":"玩 GTA 6 不发图，如 _______。","body":"玩 GTA 6 不发图，如 _______。","url":"https://m.okjike.com/originalPosts/6afdd9e3320fd7e1b568330d","image":{"url":"https://cdnv2.ruguoapp.com/Fu2mZu1CiLmAfE0Ou4EeLrOAuOinv3.heic?imageMogr2/meta-keep-list/ZXhpZixVc2VyQ29tbWVudA==/format/jpeg/thumbnail/1080x%3E"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T01